  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/533835/diamond-spheres-hustle-bustle?src=newest%3Faffiliate_id%3D3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Hustle &amp; Bustle</a></sup></p>\n<p>You gain Bluff, Heal, Intimidate, and Survival as class skills. You can use your Constitution modifier instead of the normal ability modifier when attempting one of the skills gained as class skills with this talent, chosen when you take this talent.</p>\n<p>You may select this talent a second time, in which case you may use the better of the two ability score modifiers on all of the listed skills.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/vocation#toc84\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
